Derived material (every fixture also carries a `source:` entry in conformance/corpus/manifest.yaml
with the libyang file, tag/commit and license):

- conformance/tools/extract-utests/ reads tests/utests/**/*.c and writes schemas, data and expected
  outcomes derived from them. The tool contains no libyang code; its output does.
- Any conformance/corpus/<set>/ directory whose manifest `source` points at libyang tests/
  (tests/utests extractions, tests/yanglint modules and data, tests/modules, tests/fuzz seeds).
  Each set is listed here when it lands:
  - conformance/corpus/ut-ietf-types/ (tests/utests/types/inet_types.c, yang_types.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-lref-union/ (tests/utests/types/leafref.c, union.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-string-data/ (tests/utests/types/string.c, test_data_xml and test_data_json).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-scalar/ (tests/utests/types/boolean.c, decimal64.c, empty.c, binary.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-restriction/ (tests/utests/restriction/test_pattern.c, test_range.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-ident-instid/ (tests/utests/types/identityref.c, instanceid.c, instanceid_keys.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-string-schema/ (tests/utests/types/string.c, test_schema_yang).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-ext/ (tests/utests/extensions/test_metadata.c, test_structure.c, test_yangdata.c, schema/test_schema.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-int/ (tests/utests/types/int8.c … uint64.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-schema-load/ (tests/utests/schema/test_tree_schema_compile.c, test_schema.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-bits-enum/ (tests/utests/types/bits.c, enumeration.c).
  - conformance/corpus/ut-xpath/ (tests/utests/basic/test_xpath.c).
- docs/conformance/utests-inventory.md quotes counts and file names from that suite.

